# Mutations for FloatSlots.tla. Each is a plausible bug in float-lock.ts or
# refill.ts and names the one property that must fail on it.

mutation give frees a slot and also wakes a waiter (double give)
detects SlotConservation
- /\ UNCHANGED free
+ /\ free' = free + 1

mutation take parks a caller while one slot is still free
detects NoStrandedWaiter
- /\ IF free > 0
+ /\ IF free > 1

mutation the slot timer rejects without splicing the waiter out
detects NoGrantAfterTimeout
- /\ waiting' = SelectSeq(waiting, LAMBDA x : x # c)
+ /\ UNCHANGED waiting

mutation the session cap checks > instead of >=
detects SessionsCount
- ELSE IF sessions[k] >= Cap
+ ELSE IF sessions[k] > Cap

mutation the outer finally keeps a zero entry in sessions
detects SessionsCount
- /\ sessKeys' = IF sessions[k] - 1 > 0 THEN sessKeys ELSE sessKeys \ {k}
+ /\ sessKeys' = sessKeys

mutation inTurn tail cleanup deletes the entry even when a later turn chained
detects TurnExclusive
- /\ latest' = IF latest[KeyOf(x[1], x[2])] = x[1]
+ /\ latest' = IF TRUE

mutation the budget does not shrink (perCall): a late turn still enters withFloat
detects NoOrphanFloat
- \/ ~expired[c] /\ Goto(c, "wf_enter")
+ \/ Goto(c, "wf_enter")

mutation give never wakes a waiter
detects TakeSettles
only slots=1 direct=3
- ELSE LET h == Head(waiting) IN
-           /\ waiting' = Tail(waiting)
-           /\ stimer' = [stimer EXCEPT ![h] = FALSE]
-           /\ pc' = [pc EXCEPT ![c] = After(c), ![h] = "granted"]
-           /\ UNCHANGED free
+ ELSE /\ free' = free + 1
+           /\ Goto(c, After(c))
+           /\ UNCHANGED <<waiting, stimer>>

mutation a rejected take never resumes into its finally
detects AllAnswered
- Reject(c) == /\ pc[c] = "rejected"
+ Reject(c) == /\ pc[c] = "rejected" /\ FALSE

mutation inTurn tail cleanup never deletes the entry
detects QueuesCleared
- THEN [latest EXCEPT ![KeyOf(x[1], x[2])] = None]
+ THEN latest

mutation a FloatBusy rejection skips the session decrement
detects SessionsCleared
- /\ Leave(c)
-              /\ Goto(c, After(c))
+ /\ UNCHANGED sess
+              /\ Goto(c, After(c))

mutation the slot timer never fires
detects reach:TakeTimedOut
- /\ pc[c] = "waitslot" /\ stimer[c] /\ expired[c]
+ /\ pc[c] = "waitslot" /\ stimer[c] /\ expired[c] /\ FALSE

mutation the session cap is never reached
detects reach:CapFull
- ELSE IF sessions[k] >= Cap
+ ELSE IF sessions[k] >= 1

mutation a settled run is not recorded, only its tail cleanup
detects TypeOK
- /\ settled' = settled \cup {<<c, kind>>}
+ /\ settled' = settled
